      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "THESEUS.\nGo lead the way; you have won it.\nIt shall be so; you shall receive all dues\nFit for the honour you have won; ’twere wrong else.\nSister, beshrew my heart, you have a servant,\nThat, if I were a woman, would be master.\nBut you are wise.",
